 ],
 "synopsis": "Sri Saradha Logistics, the promoter of India Cements Capital, has agreed to sell its 50.02% stake consisting of 1,08,58,186 shares via a Share Purchase Agreement to three new investors: Mr. Sandeep Jain, Mr. Vikas Garg, and Mr. Rahul Nagar. Following this stake sale, the new buyers have launched a mandatory 26% open offer at Rs 12 per share. The transaction, which represents a complete change in management control for India Cements Capital, is currently awaiting regulatory approval from the Reserve Bank of India. The deal details were confirmed following the company's 40th Annual General Meeting on September 15, 2026.",
